'''Haniwanwan''' (ハニワンワン, '''''Haniwanwan''''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Haniwanwan
|image = E 612.png
|first appearance = '''UL''': [[Outta This Village|Sub-chapter 45 - Outta This Village]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Pineapple Merchant|Sub-chapter 11 - Pineapple Merchant]]
|money drop = 300¢ - 1,185¢
}}

==Enemy==
A wall-type enemy similar to [[Chocolate Doge]], Haniwanwan has massive health and only one knockback. Its surprisingly powerful single-target attacks generate a level 4 [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Wave]] that all have a 20% chance to inflict knockback, freeze, slow, weaken and curse, albeit only for 2 seconds each.

==Strategy==
All kinds of [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] are useful against Haniwanwan if meatshields are spammed to dismiss its attacks. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is probably your best bet.

If Wave Shields are not an option, then Wave Immune units can also work. [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and [[Calligraphy Cat (Rare Cat)|Teamaster Cat]] are among the few [[:Category:Anti-Relic Cats|Anti-Relics]] serving this role.

